# The workstation image's build context is the repository root (compose
# builds with context: ../..), trimmed to what the Containerfile COPYs:
# the Go module (go.mod, go.sum, cmd, internal), webui (its dist tree is
# built in the image; node_modules and the e2e suites are not build
# inputs), the seed's inputs (the root package.json, skills, workflows
# and pi-web — the seed is the release checkout plus Pi Web, built in
# the image; pi-web's node_modules, its .next build cache, its e2e
# suites and its engine config are not) and dist/workstation. Everything
# else only bloats the context the daemon receives. .polyforge/release.sh
# builds from its own temp context and .polyforge/Dockerfile.verify from
# an empty one — neither is affected by this file.
.git
.github
.pi
.polyforge
docs
test
tools
deploy
NOTICE
webui/node_modules
webui/e2e
webui/dist
pi-web/node_modules
pi-web/.next
pi-web/e2e
pi-web/.polyforge
pi-web/.env
pi-web/.env.*
pi-web/.claude
pi-web/workspace
pi-web/coverage
